      <title>U.S. Highway 69 express lanes in Johnson County open soon. Less congestion, easier commutes</title>
      <link>https://www.kcur.org/news/2026-02-03/u-s-highway-69-express-lanes-in-johnson-county-will-open-end-of-february</link>
      <description>Orange cones and jack hammers have slowed drivers on U.S. Highway 69 for years. Officials announced Tuesday that express toll lanes running north and south will be open on Feb. 21. The new lanes are designed to reduce traffic and accidents.</description>
